    441  5df3							; ------------------------------------------------------------ tuning
    442  5df3							; tuneC = PLAYING's FINE TUNE + the Synthcart's TUNE TO (while it's in use),
    443  5df3							; in cents (-100..+100). The Game Boy gets it as master tune (CC 103), the
    444  5df3							; NES in its bends (tuneN, 1/64 semitones), the SID in its note frequencies
    445  5df3							; (SidTune; the notes sounding move at once). MATCH KEY sets the key's root
    446  5df3							; once, when it changes.
    447  5df3				   ScTune
    448  5df3					      subroutine
    449  5df3		       a9 00		      lda	#0
