    234  60b1							; ------------------------------------------------------------ One Key Play
    235  60b1							; CRSR DOWN or CRSR RIGHT (A = 1 / 2: which) pressed, ONE KEY PLAY on: the
    236  60b1							; phrase's next step sounds. PENTATONIC PAIRS: two notes of the key's
    237  60b1							; pentatonic scale, one apart (a third or a fourth), across the overlay's two
    238  60b1							; octaves. CHORD NOTES: one note of the chord (the keys held or latched),
    239  60b1							; over two octaves. EACH PRESS CUTS the last step or lets it RING ON (until
    240  60b1							; the next). The notes sound while either key is down (latch: until the next
    241  60b1							; press).
    242  60b1				   OkpPress
